        <p class="case-label">EXERCISE 1</p>
        <h2 class="case-title">Read pending tasks</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="detail-paragraph">
        The goal is to <strong>confirm the AI can read Notion data through our hand-built MCP tool</strong>. Read only — no creating, no updating. <strong>If reading isn't reliable, we shouldn't move on to writes or updates</strong>.
