      <!-- Exercise 2 -->
      <div class="case-header">
        <p class="case-label">EXERCISE 2</p>
        <h2 class="case-title">Create a new classroom task</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="detail-paragraph">
        The goal is to have the AI create a new row in Notion through the MCP tool. This is the first deliberate practice of "<strong>writing</strong>" — but the write is <strong>constrained</strong>. It can only add tasks, and a new task's status is fixed at「<strong>待確認</strong>」. That prevents the AI from creating something and immediately marking it done.
      </p>

      <details class="details-card">
        <summary class="details-card__summary">
          <span class="details-card__icon" aria-hidden="true">▸</span>
          <span class="details-card__title">Prompt example</span>
          <span class="details-card__hint">Click to expand the prompt</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="details-card__body">
          <blockquote class="prompt-example">
            Use the notion-classroom tool to create a new classroom task.<br/><br/>
