            Priority: 中<br/>
            Due date: 2026-09-28<br/>
            Source: 課程規劃<br/>
            Notes: 先整理成草稿，發布前需要人工確認<br/><br/>
            After creation, please report:<br/>
            1. Whether the creation succeeded<br/>
            2. The task name<br/>
            3. The status<br/>
            4. The Notion page link
          </blockquote>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="details-card">
        <summary class="details-card__summary">
          <span class="details-card__icon" aria-hidden="true">▸</span>
          <span class="details-card__title">Possible response</span>
          <span class="details-card__hint">Click to expand a sample response</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="details-card__body">
          <p class="detail-paragraph">The tool call the model made:</p>
          <pre class="code-block" is:raw><code>create_classroom_task {"title":"整理下次課程的練習指令","priority":"中","source":"課程規劃","category":"教學準備", ...}</code></pre>

          <p class="detail-paragraph">What the tool returned:</p>
          <pre class="code-block" is:raw><code class="lang-json">{
  "ok": true,
  "message": "已建立 Notion 任務。",
