}</code></pre>

          <p class="detail-paragraph">The model's reply:</p>
          <ol class="numbered-list">
            <li><span class="numbered-list__num">1</span><span class="numbered-list__text">Created successfully: yes</span></li>
            <li><span class="numbered-list__num">2</span><span class="numbered-list__text">Task name: 整理下次課程的練習指令</span></li>
